sed -i '/public Page<JobPostingResponseDTO> getCompanyJobPostings/i \    @Transactional(readOnly = true)\n    public JobPostingResponseDTO getJobPostingById(Long jobPostingId, Company company) {\n        JobPosting jobPosting = jobPostingRepository.findById(jobPostingId)\n                .orElseThrow(() -> new RuntimeException("Job posting not found"));\n        if (!jobPosting.getCompany().getId().equals(company.getId())) {\n            throw new RuntimeException("Job posting does not belong to the company");\n        }\n        return mapJobPostingToDTO(jobPosting);\n    }\n' comprova-backend/src/main/java/org/example/comprova/service/JobPostingService.java
